comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T12:11:56.953Z",codex-agent,"Verified PRRT_kwDOSZpews6vETQG: comments 13 and 15 are malformed duplicates; keep clean comment 14. Latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range findings. Main d5172f8 differs from audited 4ae2245 only in release version metadata. All eleven reconciliation verdicts remain supported; immutable history must stay byte-for-byte preserved. Self-review also found metadata prefix in comment 6 of pm-todos-p60g; correct current prose through pm comments --edit. Tracker-only evidence validation replaces implementation revert tests."
  "2026-10-22T12:14:26.095Z",codex-agent,"Tracker evidence proof: the same linked semantic TOON-decoding check against pre-fix snapshot 9cddd1a exits 1 with 1/3 comment assertions; current tracker passes 3/3. Existing history streams are preserved 11/11 byte-for-byte in both comparisons. Linked node evidence command and git diff --check passed 2/2 via pm test pm-todos-review140 --run --progress, zero timeouts/skips/failures. Current main d5172f8 retains release OIDC/ref/preflight guards, stable changelog dates, canonical complete reader, merged legacy importer and context-isolation fixes, CodeQL and pinned gated callers; duplicate coverage ownership still points to open pm-todos-qpst. No implementation code changed; no dist files are tracked. npm ci passed with zero vulnerabilities. Remaining tracker-only gates: regenerate changelog, check changelog and report health diagnostics. Complex comma-containing linked commands require --add-json; the initial --add attempt was refused before any tracker mutation."
  "2026-10-22T12:16:32.673Z",codex-agent,"Final self-review strengthened the linked history assertion to every history stream present at pre-fix head 9cddd1a, including streams for retired items: all 93/93 retain their original bytes. Snapshot proof remains red at 1/3 comment assertions and green at 3/3. Whole-PR semantic malformed-comment audit passed 11/11 changed items. npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed; generation correctly moved the untagged reconciliation entries into Unreleased after the main release bump. pm health --json --output-budget unbounded exits 0, with 9/10 checks green and the existing extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.10.15:2026.10.22:pm-github warning; all history drift counts are zero. Health is not fully green. Existing tooling diagnostics are already retained by pm-todos-zpyc; dependency maintenance stays outside this tracker correction. Linked commands were replaced by remove/add because update-index with set-json accepts metadata changes only. Retain review item in_progress for orchestrator verification and release the claim before push; rerun changelog generation/check after these final tracker writes."
